flowchart TD
    Access[访问 key] --> Hash[哈希选择 Shard]
    Hash --> Record[记录访问频率]
    Record --> Hit{缓存命中?}
    Hit -- 是 --> Segment{所在分段}
    Segment -- Window --> WMru[移到 Window MRU]
    Segment -- Probation --> Promote[晋升 Protected MRU]
    Segment -- Protected --> PMru[移到 Protected MRU]
    Hit -- 否 --> Insert[新数据进入 Window MRU]
    Insert --> Overflow{Window 超容量?}
    Overflow -- 否 --> End[完成]
    Overflow -- 是 --> Candidate[取 Window LRU candidate]
    Candidate --> MainFull{Main 已满?}
    MainFull -- 否 --> Probation[进入 Probation MRU]
    MainFull -- 是 --> Compare{freq(candidate) > freq(victim)?}
    Compare -- 是 --> Replace[淘汰 victim 并接纳 candidate]
    Compare -- 否 --> Reject[拒绝 candidate]

